# ENGLISH: Build-context excludes for the frontend's own Dockerfile
# (context = this directory, so the repo-root .dockerignore doesn't
# apply here - Docker only honors one .dockerignore, at the build
# context root). node_modules/ is the big one: stage 1 runs its own
# real `npm ci` inside the image, so a host-machine node_modules/
# (different OS/arch binaries in some native-dependency cases) must
# never be copied in.
#
# HINGLISH: Frontend ke apne Dockerfile ke liye build-context excludes
# (context = ye directory, isliye repo-root ka .dockerignore yahan
# apply nahi hota - Docker sirf ek .dockerignore honor karta hai, build
# context ke root par). node_modules/ sabse bada hai: stage 1 image ke
# andar apna real `npm ci` chalata hai, isliye ek host-machine
# node_modules/ (kuch native-dependency cases me alag OS/arch
# binaries) kabhi copy nahi hona chahiye.

node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.local
*.log
